d 'Paschim Banga'? Proposal to be tabled in Assembly on Dec 9: CM Suvendu]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/west-bengal-to-be-renamed-paschim-banga-proposal-to-be-tabled-in-assembly-on-dec-9-cm-suvendu/articleshow/136097737.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136097737.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/west-bengal-to-be-renamed-paschim-banga-proposal-to-be-tabled-in-assembly-on-dec-9-cm-suvendu/articleshow/136097737.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/west-bengal-to-be-renamed-paschim-banga-proposal-to-be-tabled-in-assembly-on-dec-9-cm-suvendu/articleshow/136097737.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T15:37:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136097781,imgsize-66042.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Stop acting like Baahubali': SC raps Bihar judicial officer for FIR against SP for disobeying directions]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-acting-like-baahubali-sc-raps-bihar-judicial-officer-for-fir-against-sp-for-disobeying-directions/articleshow/136097443.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136097443.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a striking judgment, the Supreme Court criticized a judicial officer from Bihar for convicting a police officer over issues with FIR registration. The court raised concerns about the officer's understanding of contempt law and advised on necessary training. Following this, the Patna high court intervened, halting the initial conviction and shedding light on significant concerns regarding judicial conduct and adherence to legal protocols in this case.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-acting-like-baahubali-sc-raps-bihar-judicial-officer-for-fir-against-sp-for-disobeying-directions/articleshow/136097443.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-acting-like-baahubali-sc-raps-bihar-judicial-officer-for-fir-against-sp-for-disobeying-directions/articleshow/136097443.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T15:31:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136097654,imgsize-129486.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Starlink to enter India very soon': ISpA says satellite internet rollout nearing next phase]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/starlink-to-enter-india-very-soon-ispa-says-satellite-internet-rollout-nearing-next-phase/articleshow/136097023.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136097023.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/starlink-to-enter-india-very-soon-ispa-says-satellite-internet-rollout-nearing-next-phase/articleshow/136097023.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/starlink-to-enter-india-very-soon-ispa-says-satellite-internet-rollout-nearing-next-phase/articleshow/136097023.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T15:12:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136097076,imgsize-44496.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Congress-SP hold 1st round of seat-sharing talks; agreement likely in 2-4 days, say top leaders]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-sp-hold-1st-round-of-seat-sharing-talks-agreement-likely-in-2-4-days-say-top-leaders/articleshow/136096757.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136096757.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Congress and Samajwadi Party have completed the initial round of seat-sharing discussions for the 2027 Uttar Pradesh assembly elections. Leaders expressed optimism, stating that an agreement could be finalized soon, likely within two to four days. The two parties held their meeting at the residence of Congress Rajya Sabha MP Pramod Tiwari in New Delhi. Future discussions are scheduled to continue as both parties aim to challenge the BJP's influence.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-sp-hold-1st-round-of-seat-sharing-talks-agreement-likely-in-2-4-days-say-top-leaders/articleshow/136096757.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-sp-hold-1st-round-of-seat-sharing-talks-agreement-likely-in-2-4-days-say-top-leaders/articleshow/136096757.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T15:06:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136096981,imgsize-75306.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ayodhya-Janakpur train, Rs 15,000 crore package, 8 MoUs: Key takeaways from PM Modi and Balen Shah meet]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ayodhya-janakpur-train-rs-15000-crore-package-8-mous-key-takeaways-from-pm-modi-and-balen-shah-meet/articleshow/136095624.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136095624.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ayodhya-janakpur-train-rs-15000-crore-package-8-mous-key-takeaways-from-pm-mo